<description>&lt;p&gt;Myanmar drone strikes and artillery fire are spilling into Thai border villages in Tak and Mae Sot provinces, prompting Thai troops to fire warning shots and close unofficial border trade for seven days. Thai authorities have arrested two Singaporeans and three Thais for a cross-border prostitution network, six Cambodians for illegal crossing, and seized 2.74 million meth pills hidden in furniture. Chinese nationals were rescued before being trafficked to a Myanmar call centre, while border locals in Tak seek protection as the Karen State conflict intensifies. 35 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijAFBVV95cUxQbHFOdVk4T1lDRkY3b000RUxJdEFoN3BSdGUwUEJ1N2VJVnFTZzRHSXFiU0F3akNFQWxYNlhSVjgxSnZxSVh6YUV1eE5IeTktRHpzZk9wbWxocGlXVjljU0NWSnh4RkJNM2M2UGdaSjJmYlpRRHFTSFN0aUpxbDJMUVQ0YmUwdWdzOHZjMQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;9Now&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxPS1FCVDU0eWNDeVZTNWl6RVpHekRzTE5fVmJaUDV6c3RMSGk2QVJ6bVAtdkw5elV4RDRUUnUzdmxTbWF5VDZoOWNuUTlGZWdxMXF4dURSWFFrSm1McGJTaWoyaERsNjVnbFFrclAycEh1dS04NGtJMU9OX1FSRDc1LU5UbkRyZThINXlfSndhWnJKM1FiUGNaZENKLU1jZXA5NmFFb1RlU1FXYmNHQ0xYX1NiRkJnOEtBMnluc3o0ZVhMZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breaking Travel News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE9OV3dZY0pELUV0X2haRE44VTEzVERvODl0YlIzamc1VElfN3lvMkVyZGh2NFJxMEFvdEVOYmdqdEs5UXpqVm9sUmdhTThrZi1LQWh6Vko3ODNkQV9tOGRYRw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thai PBS World&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPOUJIeEFxaVAzMW9JR2FFYUtFWUdUSmE3Y1pQVUtwZi01UmJnZkh1N0h5NTZ5ak84ZGlVcjl6MG5Gbl92N1BPRWNSa2RiOUtpZmtZT2tvenFLQm50bVExQUJvVzdLbHc1aFB0WDBXYy0yZnQxUURqZThwY3BLR0lYSC1DTG5NTWNURkItekFn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Thaiger&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMi